<title>USA: Zoran wins Iomega order.</title>
<headline>Zoran wins Iomega order.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zoran Corp Friday said Iomega Corp has placed a &quot;multi-million dollar&quot; purchase order for Zoran's JPEG chips.</p>
<p>The chips will be used in Iomega's new Buz multimedia product, a video capture and editing board used with its Jaz and Zip computer disk drives.</p>
<p>Financial details were undisclosed.</p>
</text>
